.\" staged on the play image as /usr/man/PRS.
.TH PRS 1 "September 17, 2026" maux
.SH NAME
prs \- print an SCCS file
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I Prs
is not provided on maux.
version control on this project is host-side (git); maux ships
no SCCS implementation at all.
